        "content": "## Get targets\nCreate a Google Sheets connection and select the spreadsheet with targets. The sheet must have the same columns as in [this Example](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1WZRTNkHfOmgyvG8bfdfYuMUNlEXFle4hXVOoWuBQvGQ/edit?usp=sharing)."
